        h3.subgroup-title Interfaces
        p(style="color:var(--gray-600);font-size:15.5px;max-width:820px;margin:-8px 0 28px;")
          | Interface Standards provide rules that determine the operations in a server–client architecture. For instance, web mapping applications, or
          strong Web GIS
          | , fit into this pattern, where an interface is used to request maps from a map service provider.
