            h3 Blogs
            p A collection of community blog posts from developers working with OGC Standards.
            a.go(href="blogs.html") Read blogs →
          .community-card
            .icon-badge
              svg(viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
