            h3 Agora
            p Ask questions and interact with other developers in the "Developers" space of Agora.
            a.go(href="https://agora.ogc.org/c/developers/") Visit Agora →

    // FINAL CTA
    section.alt
      .wrap
        .cta-box
          h2 Who is behind the OGC Standards?
          p(style="font-size:18px;color:var(--gray-600);max-width:680px;margin:0;")
            | OGC Standards are developed through a member-driven consensus process, which creates royalty free, publicly available, open geospatial standards. The
            a(style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;" href="https://www.ogc.org/")  Open Geospatial Consortium (OGC)
            |  is the organisation which drives this process. It is supported by an active community of members, with involvement from a large range of organizations, as well as smaller ones.
          a.btn.btn-navy(href="https://www.ogc.org/about/members/") Join OGC today!

